abstract: >-
  An interactive design tool for surface drip irrigation, covering
  hydraulic network design, crop water demand and scheduling,
  van Genuchten-Mualem soil hydraulics, wetting-front geometry and
  emitter overlap, and fertigation.
keywords:
  - drip irrigation
